    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>MOTHERBOARD UNDER ATTACK</strong> \ud83e\udda0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tower Defense with circuits, viruses, and\u2026 soldering!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to defend your computer\u2019s motherboard!<br>In <i>Motherboard Under Attack</i>, you will face waves of viruses trying to invade and destroy your electronic components. Your mission? Solder components in strategic positions, manage your resources (precious solder), and prevent viruses from infecting the processor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/c9d95af6b59d362c3829cd818b23afaa.poster.avif?t=1754781521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/c9d95af6b59d362c3829cd818b23afaa.webm?t=1754781521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/c9d95af6b59d362c3829cd818b23afaa.mp4?t=1754781521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect solder (the in-game currency)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solder electronic components as defense towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based defense against increasingly stronger virus waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic management of upgrades and positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/9f91493259fec9e817f18375827d8a32.poster.avif?t=1754781521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/9f91493259fec9e817f18375827d8a32.webm?t=1754781521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/9f91493259fec9e817f18375827d8a32.mp4?t=1754781521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong>COMPONENTS \u2013 YOUR DEFENSE TOWERS</strong><br>Each tower is based on a real electronic component and has a unique function:<br>\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Diode</strong> \u2013 Fast shots against ground viruses<br>\ud83d\udd35 <strong>Capacitor</strong> \u2013 High-damage cannon, but slow<br>\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Inductor</strong> \u2013 Continuous low-damage laser, slowing viruses<br>\ud83d\udfe3 <strong>Transistor</strong> \u2013 Effective air defense<br>\ud83d\udfe0 <strong>Resistor</strong> \u2013 Slows viruses but loses durability<br>\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Fuse</strong> \u2013 Powerful explosive trap<br>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Oscillator</strong> \u2013 Generates more solder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/cdb3e5ba61f77fc2a1e2b32b3e073f6b.avif?t=1754781521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2623\ufe0f <strong>THE VIRUSES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Common Virus</strong> \u2013 Fast and numerous</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spyware</strong> \u2013 Flies but is fragile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adware</strong> \u2013 Flying and destructive against towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Worm</strong> \u2013 Infects and temporarily disables towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trojan</strong> \u2013 Ground tank, splits when destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Botnet</strong> \u2013 The boss! Massive tank that attacks towers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/76a31973d653a70ef027dbc6916d8aa2.avif?t=1754781521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>EVOLUTION AND STRATEGY</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade using solder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect batteries to unlock Bronze, Silver, and Gold levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each upgraded tower changes visually and gains new powers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>STAGE CAMPAIGN</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock stages based on your performance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach wave 25 of stage 1 to unlock stage 2</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage brings new challenges and unique objectives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbe <strong>A DIFFERENT TOWER DEFENSE</strong><br>With a retro electronic look, immersive soundtrack, and progressive challenges, <i>Motherboard Under Attack</i> is perfect for tower defense fans looking for something creative and original.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd3b Add to your wishlist and get ready to protect the motherboard at all costs!<br>\ud83d\udca5 The processor is counting on you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>MOTHERBOARD UNDER ATTACK</strong> \ud83e\udda0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tower Defense with circuits, viruses, and\u2026 soldering!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to defend your computer\u2019s motherboard!<br>In <i>Motherboard Under Attack</i>, you will face waves of viruses trying to invade and destroy your electronic components. Your mission? Solder components in strategic positions, manage your resources (precious solder), and prevent viruses from infecting the processor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/c9d95af6b59d362c3829cd818b23afaa.poster.avif?t=1754781521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/c9d95af6b59d362c3829cd818b23afaa.webm?t=1754781521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/c9d95af6b59d362c3829cd818b23afaa.mp4?t=1754781521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect solder (the in-game currency)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solder electronic components as defense towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based defense against increasingly stronger virus waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic management of upgrades and positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/9f91493259fec9e817f18375827d8a32.poster.avif?t=1754781521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com