 boss! Massive tank that attacks towers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165560/extras/76a31973d653a70ef027dbc6916d8aa2.avif?t=1754781521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>EVOLUTION AND STRATEGY</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade using solder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect batteries to unlock Bronze, Silver, and Gold levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each upgraded tower changes visually and gains new powers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>STAGE CAMPAIGN</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock stages based on your performance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach wave 25 of stage 1 to unlock stage 2</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage brings new challenges and unique objectives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbe <strong>A DIFFERENT TOWER DEFENSE</strong><br>With a retro electronic look, immersive soundtrack, and progressive challenges, <i>Motherboard Under Attack</i> is perfect for tower defense fans looking for something creative and original.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd3b Add to your wishlist and get ready to protect the motherboard at all costs!<br>\ud83d\udca5 The processor is counting on you!</p>",
